Rails Agents is mounted at /agents.

Next steps:

  1. Restart your Rails server:  bin/dev   (or bin/rails server)
  2. Open the Agents UI:         http://localhost:3000/agents
  3. Sign up with GitHub or email (4-digit code)
  4. Paste your sandbox API key to connect this app
  5. Chat with Kip to build your first agent — files land in app/agents/
     (edit those Ruby files anytime if you want)

Guide: https://rails-agent.com/start
